Hi, <br><br>My game using Bullet has just been approved on the App Store. And I am very exited about it. <br><br>You basically shape your pet using blocks of various size. It then uses some Genetics Algorithms to compute a movement that will give it life and let it walk. During the learning phase Bullet is running in a background process and go through thousands of physical steps in just a few seconds - and this is on an iPad.<br><br>You will love to shape your pet with only a few leg and see him actually using it. Or give it a snake shape and see it crawl.<br><br>It's called Learning Pets and available for the iPad here: <a href="http://itunes.apple.com/gb/app/learning-pets/id530192045" class="postlink">http://itunes.apple.com/gb/app/learning ... d530192045</a>.<br><br>Any feedback is very much appreciated.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=9104">jgagnet</a> — Sat Jun 02, 2012 6:15 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
